": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Merry Christmas!", "last_comment_created": 1795459156436, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 12, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 72, "created": 1795434720000, "id": "2124833339337060746", "video": {"preview": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2124742835433877504/img/JCZ0mor3bQfLmAmk.jpg", "mpeg": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2124742835433877504/pl/BtO1m5qJjLuMfHJk.m3u8?v=38f", "aspectRatio": [319, 180], "heightRatio": 56, "type": "video/mp4", "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2124742835433877504/vid/avc1/478x270/QV04mymNXKKFKt5Q.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1710485897563566081/mWy3bWZo_normal.png", "displayName": "MERICA MEMED", "username": "Mericamemed"}, "content": "Redcoats couldn\u2019t fathom this shit \ud83e\udd23", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 2758}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATomzHxKg", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 42, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8951696, "raw_content": "After he won in 2024 Trump should have taken a page from Newt Gingrich and written a new Contract With America that laid out the principles of MAGA. Then he should have gone to both houses of Congress and demanded they sign it.  \n\nAnyone who won't sign on gets an automatic primary challenger. As in \"President Trump won a mandate, but John Thune says he doesn't care. He's not onboard with Making America Great Again and he won't sign the Contract with America II. It's time for someone else.\"\n\nAnyone who signs but doesn't follow through, gets a primary challenger and gets called a liar and a cheat. As in \"John Thune said he would support Making America Great Again, he signed the Contract with America II, but when push came to shove he stabbed President Trump in the back. It's time for someone else.\"\n\nNow I realize that we're not in the best position to do this, but it's not the worst position. We still have President Trump. He could still do this, and if Vance wins, it could still be implemented. At the least, we could start laying the ground work for picking off the RINOs.", "author": "SuperDuperBasedMD", "created": 1795431060629, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Losferwords", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Contract With America II: MAGA's revenge", "last_comment_created": 1795435278335, "content": "<p>After he won in 2024 Trump should have taken a page from Newt Gingrich and written a new Contract With America that laid out the principles of MAGA. Then he should have gone to both houses of Congress and demanded they sign it.</p>\n<p>Anyone who won't sign on gets an automatic primary challenger. As in &quot;President Trump won a mandate, but John Thune says he doesn't care. He's not onboard with Making America Great Again and he won't sign the Contract with America II. It's time for someone else.&quot;</p>\n<p>Anyone who signs but doesn't follow through, gets a primary challenger and gets called a liar and a cheat. As in &quot;John Thune said he would support Making America Great Again, he signed the Contract with America II, but when push came to shove he stabbed President Trump in the back. It's time for someone else.&quot;</p>\n<p>Now I realize that we're not in the best position to do this, but it's not the worst position. We still have President Trump. He could still do this, and if Vance wins, it could still be implemented. At the least, we could start laying the ground work for picking off the RINOs.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 42, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATomyA6NQ", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 1142, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8950814, "raw_content": "", "author": "I-am-Orlando", "created": 1795366372854, "profile_picture": "TEnkk5XkT6JN", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "okboomer59", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATomyA6NQ.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/4AnsNxk7VbkZ.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/KjGiV2CrWxgPIBtP.jpeg", "width": 768, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 515}], "blurhash": "U57w?2%MMx^+~qIUxu?b-;IUt6-;_3Rjae-:", "full_resolution": [724, 1080]}, "title": "Putin: Putin didn't open our southern border and let 20 million illegals invaders in, the Democrat party did.", "last_comment_created": 1795446287055, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 236, "score_up": 1142, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_l